OL,3,AWayfair among firms fined millions for
OL,4,Amisleading sales tactics
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt and Appliances Direct have been
OL,7,Fordered to refund customers a total of
OL,8,F#440,000. Wayfair and Appliances Direct
OL,9,Fsaid the CMA's fines were
OL,10,Fdisproportionate.
